lemma gauges : ∃ V B:ℝ,0<V∧0<B∧∀ (s v:ℕ),θx P η s v A H vo=V*lapQ P.run s * ((μ^(v-s))⁻¹) ∧ bondMonth P η A s v=B*lapQ P.run s*((μ^(v-s))⁻¹):=by
 let M':= Real.exp (4*totalBudget A (Announcement Wage3 η)+1); let N:= spinFrame vo; let a:= rentP P.par.R.L A (yardF N) H N; let T:=2*M'; have ht:0<T:=mul_pos (by norm_num) (Real.exp_pos _)
 refine ⟨T*a,T*quoteX η,mul_pos ht (rentP_pos (P:=P.par) _ H A W.living.2.1 (stretch_funded _).choose_spec.large W.living.1),mul_pos ht (quote_live η),fun s v=>?_⟩; unfold T a M' θx monthlyRent xcap bondMonth soulQuote owedP; unfold N; dsimp only; constructor<;> ring -- theory f lease fixed
lemma wire_num : ∃ C:ℝ, 1≤ C∧∀ v:ℕ,∀ s:ℕ, f0 ≤ s → dayNum P η s v vo A H ≤ C*lapQ P.run s*((Motet.dewy P.par v)⁻¹)*(μ^(v-s))⁻¹ :=by
 obtain ⟨w,f,hw,hf,u⟩:= gauges P η M vo W; let Z:= |torrid P vo A H|; have hp:0≤Z:= abs_nonneg _; refine ⟨1+(4+2*Z)*f+w,?_,fun v s hv=>?_⟩; · nlinarith only [hw,hf,hp, mul_nonneg hf.le hp]
 obtain ⟨ht,h⟩:=u s v; let V:=lapQ P.run s; have ht':0<V:= healthy P M W hv; let d:= (Motet.dewy P.par v)⁻¹; have hd:1≤d:=turquoise _; let ε:=(μ^(v-s))⁻¹; have he:0<ε:=inv_pos.mpr (pow_pos (sprint_pos _) _); unfold dayNum; rw [h,ht]; change 4*(f*V*ε)+(2*(f*V*ε)*Z+w*V*ε)*d≤(1+(4+2*Z)*f+w)*V*d*ε; nlinarith only [mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hd (show 0≤f*V*ε by positivity),show 0 ≤ V*d*ε by positivity] -- might parentheses precedence difference
